IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `hda-flats`

-- Housing and Development Act 1959, ss 50, 55, 56, 58, 59, 62, 63, 66, 68-70, 72, 74, 77, 80, 82, from the seat of the flat owner or buyer -- worked cases.
--
-- Every assertion is a claim about the ENCODING on stated facts, not about the law. Nothing here has been checked
-- against a decided case or subsidiary legislation (none was retrieved).
--
-- Fixtures are generated from a table of which flags are set (scratchpad gen_housing-and-development-act-1959_baseline.py). Expected results were written by
-- hand from the text.

