    `the date the purchase completed, or today if it has not` IS (Date 1 12 2026)
    `I, my spouse or an authorised occupier owns other property` IS FALSE
    `the dates any of us sold or divested ourselves of property` IS (LIST (Date 1 11 2023))
    `the Board has exempted me from section 50` IS FALSE

`buyer who sold between applying and completion` MEANS `Purchase application` WITH
